============================================================
WORKFLOW 4: MULTI-FACETED REVIEW ANALYTICS
============================================================
Collection: TripReviews
Purpose: Rating distribution, frequent feedback tags, average rating
Required operators: $facet, $unwind, $group, $sort
Document count: 100000

------------------------------------------------------------
PIPELINE
------------------------------------------------------------
[
  {
    '$facet': {
      rating_distribution: [
        {
          '$group': {
            _id: '$rating',
            count: {
              '$sum': 1
            }
          }
        },
        {
          '$sort': {
            _id: -1
          }
        }
      ],
      common_feedback: [
        {
          '$unwind': '$feedback_tags'
        },
        {
          '$group': {
            _id: '$feedback_tags',
            total_occurrences: {
              '$sum': 1
            }
          }
        },
        {
          '$sort': {
            total_occurrences: -1
          }
        },
        {
          '$limit': 10
        }
      ],
      overall_average_rating: [
        {
          '$group': {
            _id: null,
            average_rating: {
              '$avg': '$rating'
            }
          }
        },
        {
          '$project': {
            _id: 0,
            average_rating: 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]

